lace_odds.place_id is NHC's printed name and no table the API can read holds its latitude or longitude (STOP-P)."},"nhc_terms":"NOAA/NHC products are public domain. They are served as the bank parsed them, are not presented as NHC's own official display, and imply no endorsement."}